    <tu creationdate="20210827T191431Z" creationid="DESKTOP-VNO6T3Q\Dell" changedate="20210827T091832Z" changeid="DESKTOP-VNO6T3Q\Dell" lastusagedate="20210827T091832Z">
      <prop type="x-Context">-5093060673327133887, 4819543353873521542</prop>
      <prop type="x-Origin">TM</prop>
      <prop type="x-ConfirmationLevel">Translated</prop>
      <tuv xml:lang="en-GB">
        <seg>(2)	The protection of public figures is the responsibility of the host Member State.</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv xml:lang="mk-MK">
        <seg>(2) Заштитата на јавните личности е одговорност на земјата членка домаќин. Заш</seg>
      </tuv>
      <prop type="x-CELEX">32009D0796</prop>
      <prop type="x-SourceTUIndex">12</prop>
      <prop type="x-MK2Provenance">final dry run accepted clean HIGH</prop>
    </tu>
    <tu creationdate="20210827T092642Z" creationid="DESKTOP-VNO6T3Q\Dell" changedate="20210827T092642Z" changeid="DESKTOP-VNO6T3Q\Dell" lastusagedate="20210827T092642Z">
      <prop type="x-Context">3070801027887032993, -8245765037305491577</prop>
      <prop type="x-Origin">TM</prop>
      <prop type="x-ConfirmationLevel">Translated</prop>
      <tuv xml:lang="en-GB">
        <seg>Protective measures of the host Member State are based solely on the legal provisions in force in that Member State and the relevant international agreements.</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv xml:lang="mk-MK">
        <seg>титните мерки на земјата членка домаќин се темелат исклучиво на законските одредби кои се во сила вона таа земја членка и на релевантните меѓународни спогодбидоговори.</seg>
      </tuv>
      <prop type="x-CELEX">32009D0796</prop>
      <prop type="x-SourceTUIndex">13</prop>
      <prop type="x-MK2Provenance">final dry run accepted clean HIGH</prop>
    </tu>
    <tu creationdate="20210827T193827Z" creationid="DESKTOP-VNO6T3Q\Dell" changedate="20210827T091832Z" changeid="DESKTOP-VNO6T3Q\Dell" lastusagedate="20210827T091832Z">
      <prop type="x-Context">-7358814117077192774, -9040065489467276673</prop>
      <prop type="x-Origin">TM</prop>
      <prop type="x-ConfirmationLevel">Translated</prop>
      <tuv xml:lang="en-GB">
        <seg>(4)	It is therefore considered appropriate to amend Council Decision 2002/956/JHA of 28 November 2002 setting up a European Network for the Protection of Public Figures (<ph x="1" type="ph38" />) so that it would also apply to persons in a non-official position who are deemed to be under threat because of their contribution to or impact on the public debate,</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv xml:lang="mk-MK">
        <seg>ционалните органивласти. (4)Затоа се смета дека е соодветно да се измени Одлуката 2002/956/ПВР на Советот од 28 ноември 2002 година за формирање на Европска мрежа за заштитае на јавните личности () така што и да важи за лица кои не се на службени позиции меѓутоа се под напосредна закана заради нивниот придонес или влијание во јавната расправа,</seg>
      </tuv>
      <prop type="x-CELEX">32009D0796</prop>
      <prop type="x-SourceTUIndex">15</prop>
      <prop type="x-MK2Provenance">final dry run accepted clean HIGH</prop>
    </tu>
    <tu creationdate="20210826T194707Z" creationid="DESKTOP-VNO6T3Q\Dell" changedate="20210826T194707Z" changeid="DESKTOP-VNO6T3Q\Dell" lastusagedate="20210826T194707Z">
